---
// FAQ — kills the top objections of a skeptical first-time buyer (2026-07-03, from the
// conversion-copy workflow, honesty-reviewed). Native <details> accordion — no JS. The
// Updated 2026-09-30: the old "why be my first client" answer was inaccurate (Caleb has done paid
// independent consulting, 2022–23). Answers may contain simple HTML (links) — rendered via set:html.
// Pricing stays number-free ("fixed price, scoped on the call") per Caleb's default.
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Have you actually done this before?',
    a: 'Yes. I’ve spent nine years building production software in healthcare and fintech, consulted independently on a government health-data project, and today I build and run automations and software for local organizations — from a church’s weekly content pipeline to a contractor’s lead-capturing website (<a href="/portfolio/">see the work</a>). You talk directly to the person who built all of it, not an account manager or a junior dev handed your project. And the first call comes with a simple guarantee: I’ll find you at least 5 hours a week back, or tell you straight there’s nothing here worth building.',
  },
  {
    q: 'My business is small and I’m not techy. Is this even for me?',
    a: 'This is built for that. If you can describe the annoying task you keep doing by hand, that’s all you need to bring. I handle the technical side and explain everything in plain language — no jargon test to pass.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Will I need to babysit this thing once it’s running?',
    a: 'No — that’s the point. My clearest example so far is a content pipeline I built as a volunteer for my church, running unattended since early 2026 at about an hour of my time a month. That’s the same “set it up right, then leave it alone” outcome I aim for with paid work.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What if it breaks, or you disappear?',
    a: 'If something breaks, you call me and I fix it — that’s part of the deal. I also build things to hand off: clear docs, no secret black box. If you ever wanted to walk away from me, you could.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How much does it cost?',
    a: 'I don’t quote a price until I understand what you actually need. We start with a free 20-minute call, and if it makes sense to move forward, you get a fixed price for the defined scope before any work starts — no open-ended hourly bill, no surprises.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How long does it take?',
    a: 'Depends on scope, but most of these run days to a couple weeks, not months. The call is where we nail down the real timeline for your case.',
  },
  {
    q: 'I’m an advisor, broker, or CPA. Can I refer clients to you?',
    a: 'Please do. I work alongside the advisors a business owner already trusts, and I stay in my lane — systems and software, never financial, legal, or tax advice. <a href="/advisors/">Here’s how a referral works.</a>',
  },
];
---

<section id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-header">
      <div class="problem-label">Questions</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">The honest answers.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      {faqs.map((f) => (
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">
            <span>{f.q}</span>
            <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="faq-a" set:html={f.a} />
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #faq { padding: clamp(var(--space-16), 10vw, var(--space-24)) 0; }
  .faq-header { margin-bottom: var(--space-10); }
  .faq-list { max-width: 46rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .faq-item { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .faq-q {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-4);
    cursor: pointer; list-style: none; padding: var(--space-5) 0;
    font-size: var(--text-base); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .faq-q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-chevron { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); transition: transform var(--transition); }
  .faq-item[open] .faq-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }
  .faq-a :global(a) { color: var(--color-primary); }
  .faq-a { font-size: var(--text-base); color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 var(--space-5); max-width: 60ch; }
</style>
